{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using PCA encoding (pca_n2000) with average pooling aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727, an improvement over the singleprofile baseline (0.485 accuracy). This suggests multiprofile settings may provide value, but the specific contribution of aggregation methods or profile integration remains unclear. Further experiments are needed to isolate the impact of different aggregation strategies and multimodal interactions."
}

